{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-words-panel-ui-shell-01","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"10","surface":"panel","area":"panel/ui-shell","refs":["F-panel-509","F-panel-1129","F-panel-502","F-panel-511","F-panel-501","F-panel-1109"],"severity":"S4","title":"In Hinglish, Your numbers on Today, Your growth, the offline line, the member card, MettleUp access and the bell's update summary stay in English","what":"With Hinglish on, Today is meant to read in Hinglish, but its Your numbers tiles and the lists behind them stay in English. So do the Your growth page and its print report, the Offline line and the waiting list, the member card sheet, the put-on-your-phone card, MettleUp access, Download a backup and Delete our gym, the WhatsApp one-by-one sheet, the Screen colours switch name and the update summary in the bell ('Update of ...', 'See what's new'). The menu says 'Aapki growth' but the page it opens is headed 'Your growth', so the same page has two names.","expected":"Every line on screens the app offers in Hinglish reads in Hinglish, and a menu name matches the page title it opens.","evidence":["apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/OwnerNumbers.tsx:457-458","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/BusinessGrowth.tsx:82-83","apps/dashboard/src/crm/lang/hinglish.ts:24","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/offline.tsx:26","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/MemberCardSheet.tsx:84","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/InstallCard.tsx:77-81","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/ForgeAccessCard.tsx:26-36","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/GymDataActions.tsx:24-29","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/WhatsAppSheet.tsx:85","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/ThemeToggle.tsx:23","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/WhatsNew.tsx:170","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/WhatsNew.tsx:188"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"shell-words-not-wrapped-for-hinglish","who":"owners","how_often":"every time Hinglish is on","fix_line":"Wrap these lines for translation and add their Hinglish, starting with the Today tiles and the Your growth title.","fix_size":"medium","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-words-panel-ui-shell-02","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"gap-10","surface":"panel","area":"panel/ui-shell","refs":["F-panel-511"],"severity":"S3","title":"The member card says 'show it at the desk', but the desk cannot scan it or find the member by its number","what":"The member card carries a card number (for example 'No. 4821 0937') and a QR, and the WhatsApp message sent with it says 'Please show it at the desk'. Nothing in the admin app reads the QR, and the member search looks only at names, phone digits and email, so typing the card number finds nobody, or a member whose phone happens to contain those digits. The card number is not saved anywhere; it is worked out from the member's record only when the card is drawn.","expected":"Showing the card at the desk does something: the desk can type the card number or scan the QR and land on that member. Until then the card and its message do not suggest it.","evidence":["apps/dashboard/src/crm/logic/memberCard.ts:107-112","apps/dashboard/src/crm/logic/memberCard.ts:80","apps/dashboard/src/crm/logic/memberCard.ts:88","apps/dashboard/src/crm/logic/memberCard.ts:95","apps/dashboard/src/crm/logic/members.ts:367-378","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/MemberCardSheet.tsx:235"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"card-number-not-searchable-at-desk","who":"members and front desk","how_often":"every time a member shows the card","fix_line":"Let the member search find a member by card number, or drop the 'show it at the desk' line.","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-words-panel-ui-shell-03","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"gap-10","surface":"panel","area":"panel/ui-shell","refs":["F-panel-505"],"severity":"S4","title":"The alert timing Save button is greyed out on opening with no word that the choice is already saved","what":"On the gym alerts card, the Save button for when the rest of the alerts come is greyed out until the owner changes something. The 'Saved' word shows only after a save made in this visit, so on opening the owner sees a dead Save button and no reason.","expected":"While nothing has changed, the card says the choice is already saved next to the greyed button.","evidence":["apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/AlertsCards.tsx:311","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/AlertsCards.tsx:315","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/AlertsCards.tsx:370-373"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"greyed-save-no-saved-word","who":"owners","how_often":"every time the card opens","fix_line":"Show 'Saved' whenever nothing has changed, not only after a save.","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-words-panel-ui-shell-04","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"gap-10","surface":"panel","area":"panel/ui-shell","refs":["F-panel-505"],"severity":"S4","title":"A notice from the open admin app shows no MettleUp picture","what":"When the admin app is open and a new alert comes in, it shows a browser notice with no picture set, so the browser draws its own default. The same alert sent while the app is closed carries the MettleUp admin icon and the one-colour badge, so the two copies of one alert look different.","expected":"Every notice the admin app shows carries the MettleUp admin icon and badge.","evidence":["apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/NeedsYou.tsx:144","apps/dashboard/public/sw.js:168"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"in-app-notice-no-icon","who":"owners and staff","how_often":"every alert while the app is open","fix_line":"Give the open app's notice the same icon and badge as the pushed one.","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
